<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Opatovice power 9mo gross rises.</title>
<headline>Czech Opatovice power 9mo gross rises.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results for nine-month period ending September 30, 1996 according to Czech accounting standards (in millions of crowns):</p>
<p> gross profit	   668.869	 vs     577.746</p>
<p> operating profit     630.695	 vs     546.810</p>
<p>sales of own goods</p>
<p>  and services	1,841.689	 vs   1,577.846</p>
<p> assets		 5,940.204	 vs   4,552.896</p>
<p> basic capital	1,311.621	 vs   1,311.621</p>
<p>Note. Full company name is Elektrarny Opatovice a.s. an eastern Czech power generating company based in Pardubice.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
